+		ARPQ used 3 of 4 and no ESTABLISHED connection. The C1
+		gate apps carry the same convention in app code (ticket
+		73b23402f0). Apps booted through app-elfloader, like
+		nginx, have no code of their own, so the library takes
+		over the job. Ticket 4ecf9dcedf.
